{"id": "122669", "name": "נכון/לא נכון על מספרים מרוכבים – z·z̄ ממשי", "qtype": "truefalse", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 1, "options": {}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\">\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\">\n<p>לכל מספר מרוכב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z\\)</span>, המכפלה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z\\cdot \\bar{z}\\)</span> היא מספר ממשי.</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"native-answer\">[[input:ans]]</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> נכתוב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z=a+bi\\)</span> ונחשב את המכפלה.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">החישוב</b><br>יהי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z=a+bi\\)</span> עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb{R}\\)</span>. אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\bar z=a-bi\\)</span>, ו-<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ z\\cdot\\bar z=(a+bi)(a-bi)=a^2-(bi)^2=a^2+b^2=|z|^2. \\]</p><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a^2+b^2\\)</span> הוא מספר ממשי (ואף אי-שלילי) לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z\\)</span>.<p style=\"text-align:center\"><b>הטענה נכונה.</b></p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "radio", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": false, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "native": {"shuffle": false, "numbering": "none", "instruction": "one", "lang": "he"}}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "native": true, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": []}], "qvnames": [], "nvariants": 1}